---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure | AutoPet" description="How affiliate links support AutoPet and how they relate to our product recommendations.">
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Transparency matters</p>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p class="lead">Some links on AutoPet are affiliate links. If you make a purchase through one, we may receive a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
    <p>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
    <p>Affiliate relationships do not guarantee a positive review or determine which products we include. We aim to explain the trade-offs, limitations, and intended use of products so readers can make their own decisions. Prices and availability can change; please confirm details with the retailer.</p>
    <p>Affiliate links are marked with appropriate link attributes and appear alongside our editorial recommendations.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .page { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: auto; padding-block: 3rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 750; }
  .lead { color: var(--muted-ink); font-size: 1.2rem; }
</style>
